{
  "name": "dsh-task-launcher",
  "version": "0.2.1",
  "description": "在会话标题下的页签行（「会话文件」左侧）加一个「任务」入口：下拉自动列出所有启用的定时任务，点一条先弹确认，确认后把该任务的提醒原文投进当前会话立即执行；另有一条内置兜底项「未缴费清单」，以及「待确认清单」（读工作区 dsh-confirm-board.json，逐条勾执行/暂缓/不做后一次性投递）。纯客户端插件（宿主半边故意为空），只读，不改核心、不碰台账文件。 | A Tasks entry in the session tab row (left of Session files): the menu lists every active scheduled task, asks for confirmation, then posts that task's own reminder text into the current session; one built-in fallback entry for the unpaid-fee list.",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis",
    "cordis-plugin",
    "client-plugin",
    "slot",
    "ledger"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/jackylong1987/dsh-task-launcher.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/jackylong1987/dsh-task-launcher#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/jackylong1987/dsh-task-launcher/issues"
  },
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "locale/*.json",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "dsh.plugin.json",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "README.md",
    "!**/*.bak*"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-session-controller",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.2 <0.3.0"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.13.0"
  }
}
